        "h": "NMS — the nine-step treatment",
        "body": "|**#**|**Step**|\n|---|---|\n|**1**|**ADMISSION TO ICU** — `L16`: **immediate transfer**|\n|**2**|**AIRWAY AND BREATHING protected** if there is evidence of compromise; **severe cases may need CIRCULATORY AND VENTILATORY SUPPORT**|\n|**3**|**IV BENZODIAZEPINES for AGITATION**|\n|**4**|⚠️ **THE OFFENDING DRUG IS DISCONTINUED** — `L16`: **absolute, immediate cessation of ALL offending neuroleptic agents**|\n|**5**|**IV FLUIDS for dehydration** — `L16` adds the second purpose: **to FLUSH MYOGLOBIN**|\n|**6**|**COOLING DEVICES and ANTIPYRETICS** for the hyperthermia|\n|**7**|**If RHABDOMYOLYSIS and ACUTE KIDNEY INJURY → DIALYSIS**; `L16` adds **ALKALINISATION OF THE URINE**|\n|**8**|**DOPAMINERGIC drugs — BROMOCRIPTINE and AMANTADINE**; **MUSCLE RELAXANT — DANTROLENE SODIUM**|\n|**9**|**ECT** — `L16`: **procedural backup if medication regimens fail**|\n\n- **⚠️⚠️ STEP 4 IS THE TREATMENT: the rest is support.** **Stopping the drug is the only step that addresses the cause**, and steps 1, 2, 5, 6 and 7 are organ support for damage already done.\n- **⚠️ Step 8, from both ends:** **bromocriptine and amantadine RESTORE dopaminergic tone** at the receptor `em-8` says was blocked; **dantrolene acts on the MUSCLE**, downstream of it. *(The two-ends reading is mine; both agents are the decks'.)*\n- **⚠️⚠️ Step 3 is the trap: IV BENZODIAZEPINES treat the agitation, and ANTIPSYCHOTICS CAUSED IT.** In an agitated patient on an antipsychotic, **the reflex drug is the wrong drug** — which is `em-1`'s third misstep and Clara's actual injury.\n\nSrc: L15 sl. Neuroleptic Malignant Syndrome — Treatment ×2, steps 1-9 as numbered; L16 sl. Immediate Life-Saving Interventions · Targeted Medical Interventions. One reading supplied per `CLAUDE.md` §4",
