        "body": "### Four things this chapter could not open\n|**Source**|**What is in it**|**Status**|\n|---|---|---|\n|**L19 p.14**|a **1275x1651 portrait figure** with **three words of text**, sitting **between the CBT and DBT slides**|**UNREADABLE without a render.** Very likely the CBT thought-behaviour diagram — **and that guess is NOT written into `th-5`**|\n|**L19 p.19**|*Additional therapies sometimes used in combination with psychotherapy include* — **three content images, twelve words, all of them the title**|**UNREADABLE.** ⚠️ **The deck promises a list and prints a picture of one**|\n|**L19 p.7**|the second *Does Psychotherapy Work?* slide — **a chart, six words**|**UNREADABLE.** Whatever it quantifies beyond the **75 %** in `th-3` is not recoverable|\n|**Book Psychiatry ch.13**, *Clinical approach to Psychotherapy*, **printed 271-277 = PDF 283-289, 7 pp**|the book's **own psychotherapy chapter** — and **the last content page of the book**|**UNREAD.** Image-only; a render needs a subagent and **none was available**|\n\n- **⚠️ This was MEASURED, not assumed.** **`pdffonts` finds fonts on all 29 pages of L19**, so **nothing is vector-outlined and nothing is hiding from the extractor** — the missing content is **genuinely pictorial**. That is the `op-refract` check, run before the claim rather than after it.\n\n### What this chapter owes nobody\n- **Nothing is deferred OUT of `ps-therapy`.** **Every slide of L19 is written here**, the two picture slides included, as far as they can be read.\n- **⚠️ Taught better elsewhere — this chapter POINTS:** **ERP → `ps-ocd`** · **the psychosocial interventions of schizophrenia → `ps-schizmgmt`** · **the rehabilitation list → `ps-sud`** · **devices → `ps-devices`** · **drugs → `ps-pharm`.** That is the `ps-pharm` handling, and it is why this chapter is shorter than its reach.\n\n### ⚠️⚠️ And the syllabus-level absence still stands\n- **PSYCHOSURGERY** — named by **L18** as one of the **four arms of psychiatric treatment** (`th-1`) — **is taught NOWHERE.** `psychosurgery`, `cingulotomy` and `lobotomy` return **zero across all 25 cached decks**, first recorded by `ps-devices`.\n- **This chapter closes the SECOND arm:** `ps-pharm` closed the first and `ps-devices` the third. **THE FOURTH HAS NO CHAPTER TO CLOSE IT** — and that is a fact about the syllabus, not about the writing.\n\nSrc: measurements with pdffonts and pdfimages over L19's 29 pages; book range from the module's book-map (Psych ch.13, printed 271-277 = PDF 283-289). Sweeps over all 25 cached decks",
