        "h": "The patho-etiological classification — the deck's most accurate",
        "body": "### NEURODEGENERATIVE dementia (PRIMARY) — three\n- **ALZHEIMER'S DISEASE** — `ge-7` to `ge-11`.\n- **LEWY BODY DEMENTIAS** — *visual hallucination is its BPSD signature (`ge-3`); the deck gives it nothing else.*\n- **FRONTOTEMPORAL DEMENTIAS** — *named, with no clinical picture at all.*\n\n### NON-NEURODEGENERATIVE dementia (SECONDARY) — eleven causes with examples\n|**Cause**|**The deck's examples**|\n|---|---|\n|**VASCULAR**|**e.g. MULTI-INFARCT DEMENTIA**|\n|**TRAUMATIC**|**e.g. CHRONIC SUBDURAL HAEMATOMA** — ⚠️ *also on the treatable list, `ge-4`*|\n|**INFLAMMATORY**|**CNS VASCULITIS · MULTIPLE SCLEROSIS**|\n|**INFECTIOUS**|**HIV · LYME DISEASE · NEUROSYPHILIS**|\n|**NEOPLASTIC**|**TUMOURS · PARANEOPLASTIC SYNDROMES**|\n|**TOXIC**|**CHRONIC ALCOHOLISM**|\n|**METABOLIC**|**e.g. CHRONIC RENAL FAILURE · LIVER CIRRHOSIS**|\n|**ENDOCRINAL**|**HYPOTHYROIDISM** — ⚠️ *treatable, `ge-4`*|\n|**NUTRITIONAL**|**VITAMIN B12 DEFICIENCY · FOLATE DEFICIENCY · THIAMINE DEFICIENCY — \"WERNICKE KORSAKOFF PSYCHOSIS\"** — ⚠️ *B12 and folate are treatable, `ge-4`*|\n|**HUNTINGTON'S DISEASE**|*listed on its own, outside the lettered causes*|\n|**PARKINSONIAN DEMENTIA COMPLEX · NORMAL PRESSURE HYDROCEPHALUS**|*both listed on their own* — ⚠️ *NPH is treatable, `ge-4`*|\n\n### Where the module already teaches four of these\n- **HUNTINGTON'S DISEASE —** `nr-movement` `mv-9`, where **PROGRESSIVE DEMENTIA is one of its cardinal features.**\n- **PARKINSONIAN DEMENTIA —** `nr-movement` `mv-5`, where **EARLY DEMENTIA is a RED FLAG** against idiopathic Parkinson's, and **dementia, late** is a non-motor symptom.\n- **MULTIPLE SCLEROSIS —** `nr-ms`; **`ps-schizmgmt` `sm-4`** also files MS and **the dementias, e.g. Alzheimer's**, in the schizophrenia differential.\n- **MULTI-INFARCT —** `nr-movement` `mv-7` carries it as a **vascular** cause in the tremor differential.\n\n- **⚠️⚠️ A row `ps-sud` `sd-8` filed:** it recorded that **WERNICKE appears in `L13` and `L16` only as a DEMENTIA/DELIRIUM DIFFERENTIAL, never as an alcohol-withdrawal syndrome.** **This is that appearance, and it is exactly one line: THIAMINE DEFICIENCY, \"WERNICKE KORSAKOFF PSYCHOSIS\", under NUTRITIONAL causes.** **No triad, no treatment, no link to withdrawal. The hole `sd-8` names is real and this deck does not fill it.**\n\nSrc: L13 sl. Patho-etiological classification of dementia (most accurate), and its four continuation slides — all in full, every cause and every example",
