        "h": "Treatment — appraise first, then four tools",
        "body": "### First appraise the presenting situation — four axes\n|**Axis**|**What it asks**|\n|---|---|\n|**EMERGENCY**|**is this an emergency?** — *`ps-emerg` is the whole of that question: suicide, catatonia, NMS, serotonin syndrome*|\n|**AETIOLOGY**|**what is causing it?** — *and `os-1`'s BODY–MIND rule says look outside psychiatry first*|\n|**SYMPTOMATIC**|**what needs relieving now?**|\n|**PREVENTIVE**|**what stops it recurring?**|\n\n- **⚠️ The order is the triage:** **emergency first, cause second, symptom third, prevention last.** *The deck prints the four as a list and never says they are ordered; **the sequence is the module's reading and it is not printed** (not taken from the course material).*\n\n### Then choose from four tools — the BIOPSYCHOSOCIAL APPROACH\n|**#**|**Tool**|**Its chapter**|\n|---|---|---|\n|**1**|**HOSPITALIZATION**|⚠️ **taught in FOUR chapters, none of them this one** — **`ps-mood` `mo-8`** gives `L9,10`'s four indications (**diagnosis · lack of social support · refusal of food or medications or non-compliance · suicide, homicide, self-harm**) · **`ps-schizmgmt` `sm-5`** gives a whole section, with **deinstitutionalisation from the 1950s** · **`ps-anxiety` `ax-9`** gives *usually not needed, and four exceptions* · **`ps-emerg` `em-7`** admits the catatonic patient **because they cannot care for themselves**. ⚠️ *`ps-interview` `iv-2` records that **TYPE OF ADMISSION** is nonetheless listed unexpanded on this same sheet*|\n|**2**|**PSYCHOTHERAPY**|**`ps-therapy`**, in full — six types, four formats, and which disorder each is recommended for|\n|**3**|**PSYCHOPHARMACOLOGY**|**`ps-pharm`**|\n|**4**|**BIOLOGICAL THERAPIES, e.g. ECT**|**`ps-devices`**|\n\n- **⚠️⚠️ Two decks, two lists:** **both are recorded.** **`ps-therapy` `th-1` already prints this list beside `L18`'s** — **DRUGS · PSYCHOTHERAPY · DEVICES · SURGERY.** **`L1,2` folds the devices into *biological therapies*; `L18` breaks them out and adds SURGERY**, which **`ps-devices` `dv-10` records as taught NOWHERE.** *Not repeated here.*\n- **⚠️ A word its own list does not earn:** ***biopsychosocial*** **names four tools that are all BIO or PSYCHO** — **no social intervention appears in it.** *`ps-therapy` `th-5`'s supportive therapy, which **improves social and community functioning**, is the nearest the module comes.*\n\nSrc: L1,2 sl. TREATMENT, in full — both columns. The triage ordering is tagged. Arms comparison: `ps-therapy` `th-1`",
